<title>USA: IEC Electronics names Stingel as Chairman.</title>
<headline>IEC Electronics names Stingel as Chairman.</headline>
<dateline>NEWARK, N.Y. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>IEC Electronics Corp said Thursday that Russell Stingel, formerly IEC's president and chief executive officer, will continue to lead the company as Chief Executive Officer and Chairman of the Board of Directors.</p>
<p>In addition, the company also appointed David Fradin as its President and Chief Operating Officer.</p>
